## Verification

- Green gates: {{TEST_CMD}}, {{TYPECHECK_CMD}}, {{LINT_CMD}} with zero warnings. Quote output —
  no "should work".
- Green gates ≠ shipped: user-visible changes get a manual smoke walk (every mode/breakpoint this
  project supports, reduced-motion if animated, every CTA actually opens/works) before "done".
- Never deploy, push, or purchase (domain, hosting) without explicit go-ahead in-session.

